{"id":72,"name":"Al-Jinn","nameAr":"الجن","nameFr":"Les djinns","place":"makkah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"72:1","fr":"Dis : \"Il m’a été révélé qu’un groupe de djinns prêtèrent l’oreille, puis dirent : \"Nous avons certes entendu une Lecture [le Coran] merveilleuse,","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/072001.mp3","w":[{"t":"قُلْ","en":"Say","tr":"qul","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"أُوحِىَ","en":"It has been revealed","tr":"ūḥiya","l":"أَوْحَى","r":"وحي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَىَّ","en":"to me","tr":"ilayya","l":"إِلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/072_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"أَنَّهُ","en":"that","tr":"annahu","l":"أَنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/072_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","en":"listened","tr":"is'tamaʿa","l":"اسْتَمَعَ","r":"سمع","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"نَفَرٌۭ","en":"a group","tr":"nafarun","l":"نَفَر","r":"نفر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/072_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"مِّنَ","en":"of","tr":"mina","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/072_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en":"the jinn","tr":"l-jini","l":"جِنّ","r":"جنن","p":"nom","a":"wbw/072_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en":"and they said","tr":"faqālū","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_001_009.mp3"},{"t":"إِنَّا","en":"Indeed, we","tr":"innā","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/072_001_010.mp3"},{"t":"سَمِعْنَا","en":"heard","tr":"samiʿ'nā","l":"سَمِعَ","r":"سمع","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"قُرْءَانًا","en":"a Quran","tr":"qur'ānan","l":"قُرْءان","r":"قرأ","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/072_001_012.mp3"},{"t":"عَجَبًۭا","en":"amazing","tr":"ʿajaban","l":"عَجَب","r":"عجب","p":"particule","a":"wbw/072_001_013.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"72:2","fr":"qui guide vers la droiture. Nous y avons cru, et nous n’associerons jamais personne à notre Seigneur.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/072002.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَهْدِىٓ","en":"It guides","tr":"yahdī","l":"هَدَى","r":"هدي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/072_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَى","en":"